# API Project Structure (`apps/api`)

This directory contains the backend API service for the Skyjo application.

## Key Files & Directories:

- **[`src/`](mdc:apps/api/src)**: Main source code for the API.
  - **[`index.ts`](mdc:apps/api/src/index.ts)**: API entry point; sets up HTTP and real-time servers.
  - **[`db/`](mdc:apps/api/src/db)**: Database connection and utilities.
  - **[`http/`](mdc:apps/api/src/http)**: HTTP layer (REST endpoints, middlewares).
    - Routes are organized by feature (e.g., [`game/`](mdc:apps/api/src/http/game), [`user/`](mdc:apps/api/src/http/user)).
    - **[`middlewares/`](mdc:apps/api/src/http/middlewares)**: HTTP middleware (e.g., rate limiting, auth).
  - **[`realtime/`](mdc:apps/api/src/realtime)**: Real-time event handling.
    - **[`index.ts`](mdc:apps/api/src/realtime/index.ts)**: Real-time server setup.
    - Event handlers are organized by feature (e.g., [`game/`](mdc:apps/api/src/realtime/game), [`chat/`](mdc:apps/api/src/realtime/chat)).
    - **[`types/`](mdc:apps/api/src/realtime/types)**: TypeScript types for real-time events and payloads.
    - **[`utils/`](mdc:apps/api/src/realtime/utils)**: Real-time related utilities.
  - **[`queues/`](mdc:apps/api/src/queues)**: Game-related queue services (e.g., AFK, countdowns).
  - **[`redis/`](mdc:apps/api/src/redis)**: Redis client and repositories for game state and messages.
  - **[`utils/`](mdc:apps/api/src/utils)**: Shared utilities for the API.

- **[`tests/`](mdc:apps/api/tests)**: Unit and integration tests.

- **[`package.json`](mdc:apps/api/package.json)**: Project dependencies and scripts.
- **[`tsconfig.json`](mdc:apps/api/tsconfig.json)**: TypeScript configuration for the API.
- **[`Dockerfile`](mdc:apps/api/Dockerfile)**: Docker build instructions for the API.
- **[`vitest.config.ts`](mdc:apps/api/vitest.config.ts)**: Vitest testing framework configuration.

## Notes
- Built with Hono (HTTP) and [Socket.IO](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/socket-io.mdc) (real-time).
- Interacts with a [PostgreSQL](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/postgresql.mdc) database via [Drizzle ORM](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/drizzle.mdc).
- Uses [Redis](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/redis.mdc) for game state and caching.
- Environment variables are handled via a central configuration system.
- Testing is done with [Vitest](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/vitest.mdc).